Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Naruto joined the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:01.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Akatsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:03.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,The first surprise is that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,joining would not make him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:05.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,He carries the Nine Tails
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the Akatsuki wants the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tailed Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:10.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Their new recruit is also
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,their target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this alternate timeline,\NNaruto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,offers a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,His help in exchange for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:17.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,protecting his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,At first, the missions give
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,him the respect he always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:20.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,But every favor comes with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:22.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,The breaking point arrives when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,his new allies demand that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,he turn against the Hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:27.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,He refuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now, both sides question his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,loyalty, and the deal that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,protected his friends falls\Napart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naruto has to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Prove himself to the\Norganization,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,or protect the people who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,still believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Could he change the Akkitsuki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:41.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,from inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Or would joining them change
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:44.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naruto first?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.35,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE WRONG SIDE OF THE STORY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.35,0:00:11.39,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE RECRUIT IS ALSO THE TARGET
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.39,0:00:17.51,Heading,,0,0,0,,ONE DANGEROUS DEAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.51,0:00:22.78,Heading,,0,0,0,,TRUST COMES WITH A PRICE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.78,0:00:27.61,Heading,,0,0,0,,THEN COMES THE DEMAND
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.61,0:00:33.73,Heading,,0,0,0,,HE REFUSES
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.73,0:00:39.96,Heading,,0,0,0,,CHOOSE A SIDE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.96,0:00:44.67,Heading,,0,0,0,,WHO CHANGES WHOM?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.67,Brand,,0,0,0,,IFVERSE ANIME / FAN WHAT-IF
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.67,Credit,,0,0,0,,ONLINE ANIME EXCERPTS / REVIEW DRAFT
